      <title>Dr. Jason Anderson named next Executive Director of LSMSA</title>
                              
      
      
      
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1672687&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
                              
      
      
      
      <description>Dr. Jason Anderson will serve as the next Executive Director of the Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts (LSMSA). His appointment is subject to approval by LSMSA’s Board of Directors, who will meet on June 15.</description>
                              
      
      
      
